    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72353" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκόπεδ-ον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>site of a house, place on
				which a house is</i> or <i>has been built,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12.325.14
			</span></i> (prob.), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Vect.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.182
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1265b24
			</span></i> ; <i>building-site</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				906.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.158
			</span></i>, etc. ; <i>site</i> of a city, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					15.23.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>the house itself, building,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				741c
			</span></i>.</div>
